//! Autogenerated scikit-learn 1.6.1 parity fixtures (numpy 2.0.2) for the
//! model-selection search layer. Do not edit by hand. To regenerate, run the
//! fixture script (numpy RandomState(7), Ridge defaults, unshuffled KFold(3))
//! and emit these literals (shortest round-trip decimals).
//!
//! Covers: GridSearchCV candidate ordering / scores / competition ranks /
//! tie-break `best_index`, validation_curve and learning_curve values.

